      "value": "An additional proposal for future compatibility if RenderSettings.fogMode will be accessible through udon: most likely Unitys \"automatic\" mode will not pick up multiple variants automatically so add world build \"hints\" to descriptor. This way SDK can detect and force all fog modes when building avatar but check world descriptor for user-specified modes",
